#: arts.cpp:344
msgid ""
"Restart sound-server now?\n"
"This is needed for your changes to take effect\n"
"\n"
"Restarting the sound server might confuse or\n"
"even crash applications using the sound server."
msgstr ""
"Ponovo pokrenuti server zvuka?\n"
"To je potrebno da bi izmjene bile upotrebljene.\n"
"\n"
"Ponovno pokretanje servera zvuka može zbuniti ili srušiti neke progame "
"koji koriste server zvuka."

#: arts.cpp:346
msgid ""
"Shut down sound-server now?\n"
"This might confuse or even crash applications\n"
"using the sound server."
msgstr ""
"Ugasiti server zvuka?\n"
"To može zbuniti ili srušiti neke programe\n"
"koji ga koriste."

#: arts.cpp:351
msgid "Restart sound server now?"
msgstr "Ponovo pokrenuti server zvuka?"

#: arts.cpp:397
msgid ""
"<h1>The aRts sound server</h1> Here you can configure aRts, KDE's sound "
"server. This program not only allows you to hear your system sounds while "
"simultaneously listening to some MP3 file or playing a game with a "
"background music. It also allows you to apply different effects to your "
"system sounds and provides programmers with an easy way to achieve sound "
"support."
msgstr ""
"<h1>aRts server zvuka</h1>"
" Ovdje možete podesiti aRts, KDE-ov server zvuka. On omogućava da u isto "
"vrijeme slušate sistemsko zvono, MP3 muziku ili igru zajedno sa muzikom u "
"pozadini, a također možete primjeniti razne zvukove za sistemske poruke, a "
"programiranje zvuka je pomoću njega značajno olakšano."

